        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "notes_definitions",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Notes & Definitions\n",
                "\n",
                "**Products** — Total Italian products in Open Food Facts.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Ingredient Coverage %** — Share of products with an ingredient list.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Additive Density** — Average number of additives per product (among products with ingredients).\n",
                "\n",
                "**Appearance Share %** — Share of products with an ingredient list that contain at least one additive whose only role is appearance (colours, glazing agents).\n",
                "\n",
                "**Category Gap %** — Share of products with an ingredient list that have no category (6.9%). The gap the category-prediction model will fill.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Data Quality Pass Rate %** — Share of automated data quality checks passing.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Additive Purposes:**\n",
                "\n",
                "* **Safety** — preservatives, antioxidants, acidity regulators\n",
                "* **Texture** — emulsifiers, stabilizers, thickeners, raising agents\n",
                "* **Taste** — sweeteners, flavour enhancers\n",
                "* **Appearance** — colours, glazing agents\n",
                "\n",
                "> Additive metrics cover only products with an ingredient list (13.6% of 266,749 Italian products). Data: Open Food Facts, licensed under ODbL."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 35,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 8
          }
        },
